      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 20 · AI Order Processing\nValidates incoming orders, scores fraud risk, confirms good orders to the customer and holds risky ones for review.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/order-processing` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Gmail OAuth2, Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"order_id\": \"ORD-5531\",\n \"customer_email\": \"buyer@example.com\",\n \"items\": [\n  {\n   \"sku\": \"SKU-1\",\n   \"qty\": 2,\n   \"price\": 499\n  }\n ],\n \"total\": 998,\n \"billing_country\": \"IN\",\n \"shipping_country\": \"IN\"\n}\n```"
      }
    }
